{"id": 7409, "date": "2026-08-28T12:46:00", "date_gmt": "2026-08-28T12:46:00", "guid": {"rendered": "https://artibits.com/?p=7409", "raw": "https://artibits.com/?p=7409"}, "modified": "2026-09-17T12:48:07", "modified_gmt": "2026-09-17T12:48:07", "password": "", "slug": "ai-enabled-isometric-quality-check-iso-qc-automation", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://artibits.com/2026/08/28/ai-enabled-isometric-quality-check-iso-qc-automation/", "title": {"raw": "AI-Enabled Isometric Quality-Check (ISO-QC) Automation", "rendered": "AI-Enabled Isometric Quality-Check (ISO-QC) Automation"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong>How AI Automated Repetitive Isometric Verification with 99% Validation Accuracy</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">A global EPC organization used contextual engineering intelligence and agentic AI to automate isometric drawing validation against P&amp;IDs, Line Designation Tables and piping specifications.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>Result at a Glance</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>99%</strong> - Validation accuracy in automated checks</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>Project Overview</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Industry:</strong> Global EPC and Oil and Gas Engineering</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Solution:</strong> AI-Enabled Isometric Quality-Check Automation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Application:</strong> Isometric Drawing Validation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Reference Documents:</strong> P&amp;IDs, Line Designation Tables, Piping Material Specifications and Isometric Drawings</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>The Challenge</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Isometric drawings had to be manually validated against multiple engineering documents before issue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Individual isometrics passed through 2 to 15 revision cycles, requiring teams to repeat the same verification activities whenever a drawing or its source information changed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Key Challenges</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Repetitive manual validation of isometric drawings</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Inconsistencies between drawings and reference information</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Repeated checks across 2 to 15 revision cycles</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Significant time spent cross-referencing documents</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limited automation within the quality-control workflow</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Difficulty maintaining traceability to source data</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>Before Automation</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>P&amp;ID + LDT + PMS + ISO \u2192 Manual Cross-Checking \u2192 Engineering Review \u2192 Revision \u2192 Repeated Verification</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Every revision created another cycle of manual comparison, review and validation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>The Solution</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Drishya AI digitized the relevant engineering documents and built a computable contextual model connecting piping systems, equipment tags, routing logic and specifications.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Agentic AI validation was embedded within the isometric quality-check workflow, enabling automated checks whenever engineering information changed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>The Solution Included</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Digitization of engineering source documents</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Contextual modelling of connected engineering information</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automated cross-document comparison</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AI-enabled isometric validation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pass, fail and query classifications</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Event-driven quality checks</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Traceability between isometrics and source data</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>How It Works</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>P&amp;ID + LDT + PMS + ISO \u2192 Contextual Engineering Model \u2192 AI Validation \u2192 Pass, Fail or Query</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">The system connects relevant engineering information within a computable model. Agentic AI</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">validates the isometric drawing and classifies each check as passed, failed or requiring engineering review.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>\n.before-after-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n}\n\n.before-after-table td {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th:first-child,\n.before-after-table th:last-child {\n    width: 50%;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .before-after-table th {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        padding: 14px 12px;\n    }\n\n    .before-after-table td {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        padding: 13px 12px;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<table class=\"before-after-table\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Before</th>\n            <th>After</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual cross-checking</td>\n            <td>Automated validation</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Disconnected documents</td>\n            <td>Contextual engineering model</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Repeated revision checks</td>\n            <td>Event-driven quality checks</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Variable review consistency</td>\n            <td>Standardized validation</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual discrepancy identification</td>\n            <td>AI-generated results</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Limited traceability</td>\n            <td>Connected source-data references</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Business Impact</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>99% Validation Accuracy</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">The automated quality checks achieved 99% validation accuracy while reducing repetitive engineering work and improving verification consistency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>The Results</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Achieved 99% validation accuracy in automated checks</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reduced manual engineering effort</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reduced verification time across revision cycles</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Improved the consistency of isometric quality checks</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Strengthened traceability to underlying engineering data</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enabled automated checks following engineering changes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Created a scalable foundation for AI-enabled engineering assurance</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>Key Takeaway</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Contextual engineering intelligence and agentic AI automated repetitive isometric quality checks while achieving 99% validation accuracy and improving engineering traceability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->", "rendered": "\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-64 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>How AI Automated Repetitive Isometric Verification with 99% Validation Accuracy</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-65 wp-block-paragraph\">A global EPC organization used contextual engineering intelligence and agentic AI to automate isometric drawing validation against P&amp;IDs, Line Designation Tables and piping specifications.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-66 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>Result at a Glance</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-67 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>99%</strong> &#8211; Validation accuracy in automated checks</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-68 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>Project Overview</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-69 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Industry:</strong> Global EPC and Oil and Gas Engineering</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-70 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Solution:</strong> AI-Enabled Isometric Quality-Check Automation</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-71 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Application:</strong> Isometric Drawing Validation</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-72 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Reference Documents:</strong> P&amp;IDs, Line Designation Tables, Piping Material Specifications and Isometric Drawings</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-73 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>The Challenge</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-74 wp-block-paragraph\">Isometric drawings had to be manually validated against multiple engineering documents before issue.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-75 wp-block-paragraph\">Individual isometrics passed through 2 to 15 revision cycles, requiring teams to repeat the same verification activities whenever a drawing or its source information changed.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-76 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Key Challenges</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-77\">\n<li>Repetitive manual validation of isometric drawings</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Inconsistencies between drawings and reference information</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Repeated checks across 2 to 15 revision cycles</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Significant time spent cross-referencing documents</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Limited automation within the quality-control workflow</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Difficulty maintaining traceability to source data</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-78 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>Before Automation</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-79 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>P&amp;ID + LDT + PMS + ISO \u2192 Manual Cross-Checking \u2192 Engineering Review \u2192 Revision \u2192 Repeated Verification</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-80 wp-block-paragraph\">Every revision created another cycle of manual comparison, review and validation.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-81 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>The Solution</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-82 wp-block-paragraph\">Drishya AI digitized the relevant engineering documents and built a computable contextual model connecting piping systems, equipment tags, routing logic and specifications.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-83 wp-block-paragraph\">Agentic AI validation was embedded within the isometric quality-check workflow, enabling automated checks whenever engineering information changed.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-84 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The Solution Included</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-85\">\n<li>Digitization of engineering source documents</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Contextual modelling of connected engineering information</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Automated cross-document comparison</li>\n\n\n\n<li>AI-enabled isometric validation</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pass, fail and query classifications</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Event-driven quality checks</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Traceability between isometrics and source data</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-86 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>How It Works</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-87 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>P&amp;ID + LDT + PMS + ISO \u2192 Contextual Engineering Model \u2192 AI Validation \u2192 Pass, Fail or Query</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-88 wp-block-paragraph\">The system connects relevant engineering information within a computable model. Agentic AI</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-89 wp-block-paragraph\">validates the isometric drawing and classifies each check as passed, failed or requiring engineering review.</p>\n\n\n\n<style>\n.before-after-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n}\n\n.before-after-table td {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th:first-child,\n.before-after-table th:last-child {\n    width: 50%;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .before-after-table th {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        padding: 14px 12px;\n    }\n\n    .before-after-table td {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        padding: 13px 12px;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<table class=\"before-after-table\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Before</th>\n            <th>After</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual cross-checking</td>\n            <td>Automated validation</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Disconnected documents</td>\n            <td>Contextual engineering model</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Repeated revision checks</td>\n            <td>Event-driven quality checks</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Variable review consistency</td>\n            <td>Standardized validation</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual discrepancy identification</td>\n            <td>AI-generated results</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Limited traceability</td>\n            <td>Connected source-data references</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-90 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Business Impact</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-91 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>99% Validation Accuracy</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-92 wp-block-paragraph\">The automated quality checks achieved 99% validation accuracy while reducing repetitive engineering work and improving verification consistency.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-93 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>The Results</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-94\">\n<li>Achieved 99% validation accuracy in automated checks</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Reduced manual engineering effort</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Reduced verification time across revision cycles</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Improved the consistency of isometric quality checks</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strengthened traceability to underlying engineering data</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Enabled automated checks following engineering changes</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Created a scalable foundation for AI-enabled engineering assurance</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-95 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>Key Takeaway</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-96 wp-block-paragraph\">Contextual engineering intelligence and agentic AI automated repetitive isometric quality checks while achieving 99% validation accuracy and improving engineering traceability.</p>\n", "protected": false, "block_version": 1}, "excerpt": {"raw": "", "rendered": "<p>How AI Automated Repetitive Isometric Verification with 99% Validation Accuracy A global EPC organization used context